{"data":{"body":"**[P3] Normalize sampling into the documented half-open interval**\n\nDividing by `0xffffffff` maps the maximum unsigned hash to exactly `1.0`, contradicting the documented `[0,1)` range and shifting the deterministic boundary. Coordinate the contract with the other SDKs, divide by `2^32` (`0x1_0000_0000L`), and add shared fixed-vector tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNGDH","finding_digest":"e7d59d7f97adf9275b8c6059f365d1f81f01b4bd532c18412ba85b880824af36","finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::shouldsample::unit-interval-normalization","line":478,"observation_digest":"def44a686c446e4739c6664655e241f3e1b117333fdc31485cca04c241ea4f74","observation_id":"aro_v1_332eu2dmirxeooogmzdflysb6p","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_47kz274xvx4sow4mmbm7gzor7a","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:08Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":478,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_lhe3pphrc4edd3gr5igz3ezkc4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:08Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
